      "rules": "Two inputs. TEXT ENTRY (the God of Time interaction): send fields.slow=true when you start typing (time slows for everyone: a window), then your orders to your hands in fields {left, right} (or text lines `l: …` / `r: …`) close it; Time charges a bolt and a debt that grows with every second the window stays open, and the initiator's Enter cuts off orders sent after it. CASTS (god powers, any time, anywhere on the globe): fields.cast {power, target: ref | [lon, lat] | name} from `powers`, paid in lightning bolts; every bolt you spend gives every rival 2 and raises Entropy. Optional zoom {level: world|region|city|character, focus}. Last demigod standing wins.",
